
Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0 ? New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount : New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount - 1);
</code>

The assertion statement is derived from the comment "@@@ If the return value is non-negative, list counts of new and old array are equal". It checks if the new array list count is equal to the old array list count if the return value is non-negative, otherwise it checks if the new array list count is one less than the old array list count.--------------------
Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0 && New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount);
</code>
