The code reads the comments that start with "@@@" and outputs the corresponding assert statements. In this case, the assert statement that corresponds to the comment "If the return value is non-negative, list counts of new and old array are equal" is outputted as "Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0 && New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount);".--------------------
Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0, "If the return value is non-negative, list counts of new and old array are equal ");
